### First page of patients (default size 20, sorted by name)
# Response shape: {"content": [...], "page": {"size", "number", "totalElements", "totalPages"}}
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/patients

### Second page of 5 patients, most recently registered first
# Sortable properties: name, email, dateOfBirth, registeredDate. Sizes above 100 are capped.
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/patients?page=1&size=5&sort=registeredDate,desc
